    {
      "source": "Create a new SessionAwareMethodInterceptor for given target.",
      "translation": "为给定目标创建一个新的 SessionAwareMethodInterceptor。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/aopalliance/intercept/MethodInterceptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.aopalliance.intercept\"><code>MethodInterceptor</code></a> implementation looking up and invoking an alternative target method having\n<code>ClientSession</code> as its first argument. This allows seamless integration with the existing code base. <br/>\nThe <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/aopalliance/intercept/MethodInterceptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.aopalliance.intercept\"><code>MethodInterceptor</code></a> is aware of methods on <code>MongoCollection</code> that my return new instances of itself\nlike (eg. <code>MongoCollection.withWriteConcern(WriteConcern)</code> and decorate them\nif not already proxied.",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/aopalliance/intercept/MethodInterceptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.aopalliance.intercept\"><code>MethodInterceptor</code></a> 实现会查找并调用一个替代的目标方法，该方法将 <code>ClientSession</code> 作为第一个参数。这使得与现有代码库的无缝集成成为可能。<br/>\n该 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/aopalliance/intercept/MethodInterceptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.aopalliance.intercept\"><code>MethodInterceptor</code></a> 能够识别 <code>MongoCollection</code> 上的方法，这些方法会返回其自身的新实例（例如 <code>MongoCollection.withWriteConcern(WriteConcern)</code>），并在尚未进行代理的情况下对其进行装饰。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Represents an operation upon two operands of the same type, producing a result of the same type as the operands\naccepting <code>ClientSession</code>.",
      "translation": "表示对两个相同类型操作数执行的操作，产生与操作数类型相同的结果，并接收 `<code>ClientSession</code>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>databaseDecorator</code> - a <a href=\"SessionAwareMethodInterceptor.ClientSessionOperator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>SessionAwareMethodInterceptor.ClientSessionOperator</code></a> used to create the proxy for an imperative / reactive\n         <code>MongoDatabase</code>.",
      "translation": "<code>databaseDecorator</code> - 一个<a href=\"SessionAwareMethodInterceptor.ClientSessionOperator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>SessionAwareMethodInterceptor.ClientSessionOperator</code></a>，用于为命令式/响应式 <code>MongoDatabase</code> 创建代理。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>collectionDecorator</code> - a <a href=\"SessionAwareMethodInterceptor.ClientSessionOperator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>SessionAwareMethodInterceptor.ClientSessionOperator</code></a> used to create the proxy for an imperative / reactive\n         <code>MongoCollection</code>.",
      "translation": "<code>collectionDecorator</code> - 一个<a href=\"SessionAwareMethodInterceptor.ClientSessionOperator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>SessionAwareMethodInterceptor.ClientSessionOperator</code></a>，用于为命令式/响应式 <code>MongoCollection</code> 创建代理。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
